他拿了一根冰棒。

330
00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:54.160
You know, the double stick Popsicle.
你知道的，就是那种双棍冰棒。

331
00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:54.480
Yep.
没错。

332
00:13:54.720 --> 00:14:00.480
And then like the ice cream cone with like the chocolate with the peanut topping thing.
还有那种带巧克力和花生碎顶料的冰淇淋甜筒。

333
00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:00.960
Yeah.
是啊。

334
00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:01.940
What's that called again?
那叫什么来着？

335
00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:03.560
Some kind of drumstick.
某种鼓槌冰淇淋。

336
00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:04.440
That's it.
就是那个。

337
00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:05.140
That's it.
没错。

338
00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:06.020
Oh, it is a drumstick.
哦，确实是鼓槌冰淇淋。

339
00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:06.580
Drumstick.
鼓槌。

340
00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:07.420
Yeah.
是啊。

341
00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:10.340
Anyway, he's got both of those going.
总之，他两样都在吃。

342
00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:11.860
But you know what?
但你知道吗？

343
00:14:11.860 --> 00:14:13.980
It's because he didn't eat his lunch.
那是因为他没吃午饭。

344
00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:16.120
Well, I mean all his lunch.
我是说，没吃完他的午饭。

345
00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:17.320
It doesn't matter.
没关系。

346
00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:19.260
Angela enters smiling.
安吉拉微笑着走进来。

347
00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:20.400
It's strange.
真奇怪。

348
00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:21.140
Beaming.
满面春风。

349
00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.440
So happy.
好开心。

350
00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:23.120
Giddy.
晕乎乎的。

351
00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:29.280
She's so happy that she looks at Kevin and you know normal Angela would just look at him
她太开心了，看着凯文，你知道正常的安吉拉只会看着他

352
00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:33.180
eating that double stick Popsicle and the drumstick and just go off on him.
吃着那根双棒冰棍和鸡腿，然后对他大发雷霆。

353
00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:34.400
But she says nothing.
但她什么也没说。

354
00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:35.300
No.
没说。

355
00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:37.860
Oh, actually, she says, oh, hello, everyone.
哦，其实她说了，哦，大家好。

356
00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:39.460
Oh, ice cream.
哦，冰淇淋。

357
00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:40.520
Nice, Kevin.
不错嘛，凯文。

358
00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:41.460
Looks good.
看起来不错。

359
00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.000
Nice, Kevin?
不错嘛，凯文？

360
00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:44.480
What is happening?
到底发生了什么？

361
00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.420
Well, I'll tell you what's happening.
好吧，我来告诉你发生了什么。

362
00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:50.160
She is going to announce a new addition to her family.
她要宣布家里添了新成员。

363
00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:55.120
It's a cat, a rare, special cat, a $7,000 cat.
是一只猫，一只稀有、特别的猫，价值七千美元的猫。

364
00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:56.740
She's hypoallergenic.
她是低过敏性的。

365
00:14:56.860 --> 00:14:58.740
She doesn't struggle when you try to dress her.
给她穿衣服时她不会挣扎。

366
00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:00.780
She's a third generation show cat.
她是第三代展示猫。

367
00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.160
Her father was in Meet the Parents.
她父亲出演过《拜见岳父大人》。

368
00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:08.860
Wait, so the cat that pees on the toilet in Meet the Parents is somehow related to Angela's
等等，所以《拜见岳父大人》里那只会用马桶上厕所的猫，和安吉拉的

369
00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:09.360
new cat?
新猫有亲戚关系？

370
00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:11.160
It's Princess Lady's dad.
那是“公主女士”的爸爸。

371
00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:12.060
Wow.
哇。

372
00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:12.740
I know.
我知道。

373
00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:14.780
Well, the gang wants to see this cat.
好吧，大家伙儿都想看看这只猫。

374
00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:16.640
They're like a $7,000 cat.
他们觉得，七千美元的猫啊。

375
00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:17.560
I got to see it.
我得见识一下。

376
00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:19.700
And Angela's like, I can do better than a picture.
安吉拉就说，我能给你们看的比照片更好。

377
00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:20.620
Oh, she can.
哦，她确实能。

378
00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:23.140
She has a kitty cam set up at home.
她在家里装了猫咪摄像头。

379
00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:29.420
So she takes the whole gang over to her computer and they are watching these cats frolic in
于是她带着大家伙儿来到她的电脑前，看着这些猫在

380
00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:29.900
her living room.
她的客厅里嬉戏。

381
00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:31.240
How many are there?
那里有多少只？

382
00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.320
I didn't count.
我没数。

383
00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:33.560
I mean, there's lots.
我是说，有很多。

384
00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:34.700
There's lots.
有很多。

385
00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:35.740
There's probably 12.
大概有十二只吧。

386
00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:40.940
I mean, there were at least seven or eight, at least, in the picture.
我是说，画面里至少有七八只，至少。

387
00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:43.040
Who knows if someone was sitting in the window?
谁知道有没有猫坐在窗户边呢？

388
00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:43.680
We don't know.
我们不知道。

389
00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:49.060
Angela, we got a lot of mail about this scene because your character mentions that she's
安吉拉，我们收到了很多关于这场戏的来信，因为你的角色提到她

390
00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:50.860
annoyed that she can't take any time off.
很烦恼，因为她没法请假。

391
00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:52.380
She doesn't have any sick days left.
她的病假天数用完了。

392
00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:54.680
And they don't recognize cat maternity.
而且公司不承认猫的产假。

393
00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:55.180
Yeah.
是啊。

394
00:15:55.180 --> 00:16:00.600
And it's not fair that she can't take off a year like those people who have human babies.
而且她不能像那些生了人类宝宝的人一样休一年假，这太不公平了。

395
00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:02.340
And Meredith agrees, right?
梅雷迪斯也同意，对吧？

396
00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:06.500
Meredith says, yeah, I had my second kid just for the vacation time.
梅雷迪斯说，是啊，我生第二个孩子就是为了休假。

397
00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:08.120
Flurry of mail.
信件如雪片般飞来。

398
00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:10.460
I mean, it was a snowstorm of letters.
我是说，那简直是一场信件暴风雪。

399
00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:14.540
Lots of people are like, how many children does Meredith have?
很多人都在问，梅雷迪斯到底有几个孩子？

400
00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:17.560
In Alliance, Dwight says she has two kids.
在《联盟》里，德怀特说她有两个孩子。

401
00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.720
In The Injury, Michael says she has one kid, no husband.
在《受伤》那一集里，迈克尔说她有一个孩子，没有丈夫。

402
00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:24.560
In Take Your Daughter to Work Day, she brings one child in.
在《带女儿上班日》里，她带了一个孩子来。

403
00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:27.400
But then here, she says she has a second kid.
但在这里，她又说她有第二个孩子。

404
00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:29.700
What does the show Bible say?
剧集设定集是怎么说的？

405
00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:35.340
I'll tell you guys, the show Bible just says whatever the show says.
我告诉你们吧，剧集设定集里写的就是剧里演的内容。

406
00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:40.080
So, the show Bible is as all over the place as these episodes.
所以，剧集设定集和这些剧集一样，到处都是漏洞。

407
00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.380
I think we don't really know.
我觉得我们其实也不清楚。

408
00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:46.060
I think maybe we didn't do a good job keeping track of the children.
我觉得可能我们在追踪孩子这方面做得不够好。

409
00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:48.120
I mean, what happens to the senator's son?
我是说，参议员的儿子后来怎么样了？

410
00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:49.020
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

411
00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:50.020
We'll get there.
我们之后会讲到。

412
00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:53.560
Children disappear and reappear all the time on our show.
在我们的剧里，孩子们总是消失又出现。

413
00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:59.960
So, I think what happens is they write the episode and they don't check the show Bible firSt.
所以，我觉得情况是他们写剧本时并没有先去查剧集设定集。

414
00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:09.460
And then the person who keeps the show Bible is like, dang it, I've got to write something in the show Bible now that contradicts what was already in the show Bible.
然后负责维护设定集的人就会想，该死，我现在得在设定集里写点什么，来和之前的内容相矛盾了。

415
00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:13.560
But, you know, their job is just to record what happens.
但你知道，他们的工作只是记录发生过的事情。

416
00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:16.700
I've gotten questions quite a bit about Princess Lady.
我经常收到关于“公主女士”的问题。

417
00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:20.480
People want to know why would she sell Andy's engagement ring?
大家想知道她为什么要卖掉安迪的订婚戒指？

418
00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:25.220
Everyone sort of really judged Angela for this on the comment boards back when the episode aired.
当年这集播出时，评论区里每个人都在某种程度上评判安吉拉的做法。

419
00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:28.980
There was a deleted talking head where she sort of explained it.
有一个被删减的采访片段，她在里面解释了原因。

420
00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:30.460
And I think we should hear it.
我觉得我们应该听听看。

421
00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:35.340
As you may know, I am no longer in a relationships.
如你们所知，我现在已经没有在谈恋爱了。

422
00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:38.620
It's been really stressful here.
这里的工作压力真的很大。

423
00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:44.200
So, I decided to treat myself to one of God's most perfect creations.
所以我决定奖励自己，买下上帝最完美的造物之一。

424
00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:46.400
A beautiful new cat.
一只漂亮的新猫。

425
00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:49.140
It's tacky to talk about money.
谈钱很俗气。

426
00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:52.530
But she costs $7,000.
但它花了七千美元。

427
00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:55.550
Okay, you guys.
好了，各位。

428
00:17:55.730 --> 00:17:57.010
Judge Angela, if you will.
你们尽管评判安吉拉吧。

429
00:17:57.150 --> 00:18:00.590
But she's had a tough time because she's no longer in a relationships.
但她确实过得很艰难，因为她已经没有在谈恋爱了。

430
00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:03.970
Both of her relationships have ended.
她的两段感情都结束了。

431
00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:06.670
And she has to work with both of them and see them every day.
而且她还得每天和他们一起工作，天天见面。

432
00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:10.170
She's sort of been shunned, kicked off the party planning committee.
她被排挤了，还被踢出了派对策划委员会。

433
00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:14.370
And she went and made an impulse buy to make herself feel better.
所以她冲动消费，想让自己感觉好一点。

434
00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:15.770
Here's what I'll say.
我只想说。

435
00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:17.450
She should have given the ring back.
她本该把戒指还回去的。

436
00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:18.810
I know that.
我知道。

437
00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:20.130
I know that.
我知道。

438
00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:21.870
Because she was unfaithful.
因为是她不忠在先。

439
00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:22.970
Yes.
没错。

440
00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:28.970
You know, the ring is a symbol of your promise of your contract to be married.
你知道，戒指是你承诺结婚契约的象征。

441
00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:36.250
And I think that if the person who has the ring breaks that contract, they should return it.
我觉得如果持有戒指的人违背了契约，他们就应该归还戒指。

442
00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:43.990
But I believe that etiquette says that if the person who gave the ring breaks the contract, you get to keep the ring.
但我相信礼仪上说，如果送戒指的人违背了契约，你就可以保留戒指。

443
00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:46.970
Well, Angela Martin's going to use hers to buy a cat.
好吧，安吉拉·马丁打算用她的戒指去买猫。

444
00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.630
She broke with the etiquette.
她打破了礼仪。

445
00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:50.130
Yes.
是的。

446
00:18:50.570 --> 00:18:51.030
Okay.
好吧。

447
00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:53.350
I mean, that's what your character would do.
我是说，这确实是你角色会做的事。

448
00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:55.970
Do you think Pam gave Roy the ring back?
你觉得帕姆把戒指还给罗伊了吗？

449
00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:57.970
I do.
我觉得还了。

450
00:18:58.830 --> 00:18:59.290
Right?
对吧？

451
00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:02.970
Now, listen, you might throw some shade at Angela Martin.
听着，你们可能会对安吉拉·马丁冷嘲热讽。

452
00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:06.850
Her affair was very out there, but I think Pam had an emotional affair.
她的婚外情确实非常张扬，但我认为帕姆有过精神出轨。

453
00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:08.070
You think?
你觉得呢？

454
00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:09.050
Of course she did.
她当然有过。

455
00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:10.250
So I'm just saying.
所以我只是随口一说。

456
00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:12.170
That's why I think Pam gave the ring back.
这就是为什么我觉得帕姆把戒指还了回去。

457
00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:15.190
Well, Princess Lady is here, folks.
好了，各位，“公主小姐”来了。

458
00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:16.010
Yes.
没错。

459
00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:23.970
Well, speaking of people who are excited today, Jim is thrilled to have purchased Kelly an ice cream cake.
说到今天很兴奋的人，吉姆很高兴给凯莉买了一个冰淇淋蛋糕。

460
00:19:24.190 --> 00:19:25.510
He's putting it in the freezer.
他正把它放进冷冻室。

461
00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:26.730
He's so proud of himself.
他对自己感到非常自豪。

462
00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:27.670
He did it.
他做到了。

463
00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:31.370
But then he hears Dwight yelling, screaming at Kelly.
但随后他听到德怀特在对凯莉大喊大叫。

464
00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:32.730
Right in her face.
就对着她的脸。

465
00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:33.530
Dwight does this.
德怀特经常这样。

466
00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:35.470
Remember when he got right in Phyllis' face?
还记得他当时直接凑到菲利斯脸前吗？

467
00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:36.030
Yes.
记得。

468
00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:38.270
Did they laugh a lot during this scene?
他们在拍这场戏时笑场了吗？

469
00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:39.950
I don't know how Mindy kept it together.
我不知道敏迪是怎么忍住不笑的。

470
00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:40.770
I'm sure.
我敢肯定。

471
00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:41.770
All right.
好吧。

472
00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:47.270
Well, the reason Dwight is interrogating Kelly is because last week he looked in her files,
德怀特审问凯莉的原因是，上周他查看了她的档案，

473
00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:54.090
trying to figure out when her exact birthday was, and he finds out that she was in juvie
试图弄清楚她确切的生日，结果发现她在14岁时

474
00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:55.670
when she was 14.
进过少管所。

475
00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:57.690
And now he wants to know why.
现在他想知道原因。

476
00:19:57.930 --> 00:20:00.010
I have one thing I have to bring up.
我有一件事必须提一下。

477
00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:03.830
I don't know why this bugged me so much, but it totally bugged me.
我不知道为什么这件事让我这么纠结，但它确实让我很纠结。

478
00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:07.790
I did that thing where I paused the TV and I talked to the TV.
我做了一件蠢事，我暂停了电视，然后对着电视说话。

479
00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:08.370
What?
什么？

480
00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:09.350
By myself.
就我一个人。

481
00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:09.930
What?
什么？

482
