Pam is in charge.
帕姆负责了。

1128
00:48:06.100 --> 00:48:09.160
She goes right into Forrest Gump.
她直接模仿起了阿甘正传。

1129
00:48:09.660 --> 00:48:14.880
Lady, this was one of my favorite shooting days ever, having to take over the presentation.
女士，这是我拍摄过最喜欢的日子之一，不得不接管演示环节。

1130
00:48:15.160 --> 00:48:17.060
It was so fun to watch you.
看你表演太有趣了。

1131
00:48:17.200 --> 00:48:18.080
It was hilarious.
太搞笑了。

1132
