Yes.
是的。

1257
00:53:48.900 --> 00:53:52.220
And he would often do that if we had a fakie piece of paper.
如果我们有伪造的文件，他经常会那样做。

1258
00:53:52.460 --> 00:53:52.980
A memo.
一份备忘录。

1259
00:53:53.500 --> 00:53:54.680
It was very detailed.
非常详尽。

1260
00:53:54.960 --> 00:53:55.280
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1261
00:53:55.660 --> 00:53:59.700
I have a question for you because when I watch this, I am always, like, relating it back
我有个问题想问你，因为当我看这段时，我总是会把它和

